From 2d794810af91df2ff7375edc2486b6fe8429a653 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vladimir Khusainov <vlad@emcraft.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 12:07:54 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] imx6sx: add the Emcraft SLX-SOM

The Emcraft i.MX 6SoloX system-on-module, SLX-SOM rev 2A, on its
LCD-SLX-SOM-BSB baseboard: 512 MiB of DDR3 set up by the DCD of
Emcraft's U-Boot 2015.04, the console on UART1, the SD card on uSDHC4,
the GPMI NAND, ENET1 with an AR8031 PHY, and USB OTG1 for fastboot and
UMS.

The board boots U-Boot from the NAND and keeps its environment on the
SD card, two copies at 0xE0000 and 0xE2000.

Signed-off-by: Vladimir Khusainov <vlad@emcraft.com>
